{"_id":"68a736138ec3d8323af14f43","nodeId":"cslVSSKBMO7I6CpO7vG1H","roadmapSlug":"data-engineer","createdAt":"2025-08-21T15:06:58.672Z","description":"# Relational Databases\n\nRelational databases store data in tables with rows and columns, and use SQL for querying. Relationships between tables are defined through foreign keys. They are the most widely used type of database for transactional applications and form the backbone of most operational systems.","resources":[{"type":"course","title":"Databases and SQL","url":"https://www.edx.org/course/databases-5-sql","_id":"6a7f4a42cb44947debcf5334"},{"type":"article","title":"Relational Databases","url":"https://www.ibm.com/cloud/learn/relational-databases","_id":"6a7f4a42cb44947debcf5335"},{"type":"article","title":"Intro To Relational Databases","url":"https://www.udacity.com/course/intro-to-relational-databases--ud197","_id":"6a7f4a42cb44947debcf5336"},{"type":"video","title":"What is Relational Database","url":"https://youtu.be/OqjJjpjDRLc","_id":"6a7f4a42cb44947debcf5337"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-14T17:02:58.294Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e04e1fb5fcb94d0417044","title":"DataCamp - Associate Data Engineer in SQL","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/WOP6XG"},{"_id":"6a5e04e1fb5fcb94d0417100","title":"DataCamp - Data Engineer in Python","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/JkYLbr"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/data-engineer/content/cslVSSKBMO7I6CpO7vG1H.md"}